abstract: >-
  An AI-assisted workbench for querying, validating, repairing and generating
  Digital Product Passport records. Answers cite supporting evidence or are
  declined when support is insufficient. Generated records are checked against
  the applied validation profile and include field-level support; repair keeps
  evidence-backed changes separate from unverified suggestions. General-purpose
  and CE-RISE profiles provide access to product records, CE-RISE data models and
  the PEFDPP knowledge graph.
keywords:
